														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2783941">
									

<p>Probably quite a bit, but at bare minimum one of the DRAM cells in the receiving computer or one of the ink particles on the paper deflected a cosmic ray particle differently, causing it to interact differently with some other particle, causing that one to interact slightly differently, and so on until it hits the lottery RNG apparatus just <em>so</em>, changing the result.</p>

							</div>

								
					
