														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2799885">
									

<p>I can't bring myself to believe that lottery RNG is as butterfly-sensitive as you're claiming it is. Yes, cosmic rays can affect DRAM cells, but those are <em>errors</em> and the nice hardware people do their best to make sure that macroscopic effects drown them out.</p>
<p>Plus, aren't many lotteries still pulling balls out of a tumbler?</p>

							</div>

								
					
